  "body": "Tucked away from the road in a peaceful setting, this character-filled home offers a wonderful sense of privacy, space and an elevated outlook. Cherished by the same owner for 22 years, it is a home with personality, warmth and plenty to enjoy.\r\n\r\nA generous floor plan features soaring pitched ceilings, exposed timber beams and light-filled open-plan living and dining. The practical kitchen offers ample storage and bench space. Three well-proportioned bedrooms are thoughtfully arranged, with one downstairs and two upstairs. The master bedroom opens directly onto an elevated deck, enjoying a particularly pleasant outlook and a wonderful sense of privacy. The upstairs hallway features a built-in cupboard that could be easily transformed into a handy study nook.\r\n\r\n  Outdoor living is a real highlight. Expansive timber decks create inviting spaces for entertaining, dining or simply relaxing, overlooking established gardens and a private, usable lawn.\r\n\r\nThe main bathroom, a separate guest powder room, a lock-up garage with storage and additional off-street parking complete the picture.\r\n\r\nThis tucked-away Torbay retreat offers character, privacy and a lovely connection to the outdoors, with abundant greenery and birdlife. Beaches, village shops and coastal walks are all within easy reach.\r\n\r\nA special home with space to relax, room to entertain and a setting worth discovering.",
